        "answer": {
          "short": "$TP=10\\text{ cm}$",
          "worked": "The tangent squared equals the product of the external and entire secant lengths.\n$$\\begin{align*}TA&=5+15\\\\&=20\\text{ cm}\\\\TP^2&=TB\\times TA\\\\TP^2&=5\\times20\\\\TP^2&=100\\\\TP&=10\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
